---
import YogaLayout from '../../../layouts/YogaLayout.astro';
---
<YogaLayout title="Offerings | Setsuko Hata Yoga"
  description="Upa Yoga, Surya Shakti, and Surya Kriya: authentic Hatha Yoga programs codified by Sadhguru."
  locale="en"
  active="classes"
  ogTitle="Setsuko Hata Yoga Studio"
  ogDescription="Authentic Hatha Yoga instruction by a Sadhguru Certified teacher, trained over 1,750 hours in India. Classes in Tokyo and Osaka, and corporate wellness programs."
  themeColor="#EEF0E6"
  alternateHref="/hatha-yoga/ja/offerings/"
>

        <section class="ja-band ja-band-sage pt-32 pb-24 md:pt-40 md:pb-32">
          <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-6 md:px-10">
            <p
              class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss"
            >
              Offerings
            </p>
            <h1
              class="mt-6 max-w-3xl font-display text-5xl leading-[1.05] text-brand-espresso md:text-7xl"
            >
              Our Programs
            </h1>
            <p class="mt-8 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso">
              Upa Yoga, Surya Shakti, and Surya Kriya: authentic Hatha Yoga
              programs codified by Sadhguru.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="bg-[#f5efe6]">
          <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-10 py-20 md:py-28">
            <div class="grid items-center gap-12 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-20">
              <div class="relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden">
                <img
                  src="https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3GPbQMbfR1ccKRGYF3GMm7Snyeb/hf_20260713_014348_0ffe647e-2fb8-42bd-91f4-f4436580e897.png"
                  alt="Upa Yoga"
                  loading="lazy"
                  class="h-full w-full object-cover"
                />
                <div
                  class="absolute left-4 top-4 font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-espresso"
                >
                  01<!-- -->
                  /
                  <!-- -->02
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p
                  class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss"
                >
                  Ten practices to begin
                </p>
                <h2
                  class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl leading-tight md:text-5xl"
                >
                  Upa Yoga
                </h2>
                <p
                  class="mt-6 max-w-md text-lg leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/80"
                >
                  Ten simple practices that gently work the joints, muscles, and
                  energy pathways, easing a stiff body and mind from the inside
                  out.
                </p>
                <ul class="mt-8 space-y-3">
                  <li class="flex gap-3 text-sm text-brand-espresso/85">
                    <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-brand-moss">─</span
                    ><span>Slowly releases stored stress and fatigue</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="flex gap-3 text-sm text-brand-espresso/85">
                    <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-brand-moss">─</span
                    ><span>Gently works the joints and muscles</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="flex gap-3 text-sm text-brand-espresso/85">
                    <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-brand-moss">─</span
                    ><span>Revives a body that has sat still too long</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="flex gap-3 text-sm text-brand-espresso/85">
                    <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-brand-moss">─</span
                    ><span
                      >Quietly resets rhythm disrupted by travel or jet
                      lag</span
                    >
                  </li>
                </ul>
                <dl
                  class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 border-t border-brand-espresso/15 pt-6 text-sm"
                >
                  <div>
                    <dt
                      class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-moss"
                    >
                      Format
                    </dt>
                    <dd class="mt-2 text-brand-espresso/85">10 practices</dd>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <dt
                      class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-moss"
                    >
                      Suited for
                    </dt>
                    <dd class="mt-2 text-brand-espresso/85">
                      First-time practitioners, or as preparation for the other
                      programs
                    </dd>
                  </div>
                </dl>
                <div class="mt-10">
                  <a
                    href="/hatha-yoga/en/contact/"
                    class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-7 py-3.5 text-[14px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] font-medium transition-colors duration-300 active:translate-y-px bg-brand-espresso text-white hover:bg-brand-moss"
                    >Book a Class</a
                  >
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="bg-[#f5efe6]">
          <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-10 py-20 md:py-28">
            <div class="grid items-center gap-12 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-20">
              <div class="relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden">
                <img
                  src="https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3GPbQMbfR1ccKRGYF3GMm7Snyeb/hf_20260713_014414_813724c7-cf90-4d5e-8f7d-523b062f5347.png"
                  alt="Surya Shakti, Surya Kriya"
                  loading="lazy"
                  class="h-full w-full object-cover"
                />
                <div
                  class="absolute left-4 top-4 font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-espresso"
                >
                  02<!-- -->
                  /
                  <!-- -->02
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p
                  class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss"
                >
                  A solar practice, passed down from India
                </p>
                <h2
                  class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl leading-tight md:text-4xl"
                >
                  Surya Shakti / Surya Kriya
                </h2>
                <p
                  class="mt-6 max-w-md text-base leading-loose text-brand-espresso/80"
                >
                  An authentic Hatha Yoga program passed down for thousands of
                  years in India. It harmonizes the solar cycle with your own
                  life, working from the inside to align body, mind, and life
                  energy. Unlike ordinary yoga or stretching, it is a powerful
                  practice that brings transformation at the level of body
                  and energy itself.
                </p>

                <div class="mt-10 border-t border-brand-espresso/15 pt-8">
                  <p class="flex items-center gap-2 font-display text-xl md:text-2xl">
                    <span aria-hidden="true">🔥</span
                    ><span>Surya Shakti</span>
                  </p>
                  <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/80">
                    A traditional Hatha Yoga practice that raises life energy
                    and builds a body that is both supple and strong.
                  </p>
                  <ul class="mt-5 space-y-2.5">
                    <li class="flex gap-3 text-sm text-brand-espresso/85">
                      <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-brand-moss">─</span
                      ><span>Raises life energy and vitality</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex gap-3 text-sm text-brand-espresso/85">
                      <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-brand-moss">─</span
                      ><span>Builds strength, flexibility, and endurance</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex gap-3 text-sm text-brand-espresso/85">
                      <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-brand-moss">─</span
                      ><span>Improves posture and physical balance</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex gap-3 text-sm text-brand-espresso/85">
                      <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-brand-moss">─</span
                      ><span>Activates metabolism and bodily function</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex gap-3 text-sm text-brand-espresso/85">
                      <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-brand-moss">─</span
                      ><span>Toward a body that tires less and feels lighter</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex gap-3 text-sm text-brand-espresso/85">
                      <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-brand-moss">─</span
                      ><span>Sharpens focus, drive, and performance</span>
                    </li>
                  </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-8 border-t border-brand-espresso/15 pt-8">
                  <p class="flex items-center gap-2 font-display text-xl md:text-2xl">
                    <span aria-hidden="true">☀️</span
                    ><span>Surya Kriya</span>
                  </p>
                  <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/80">
                    A profound practice that deeply harmonizes body, breath,
                    and life energy, aligning body and mind from within.
                  </p>
                  <ul class="mt-5 space-y-2.5">
                    <li class="flex gap-3 text-sm text-brand-espresso/85">
                      <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-brand-moss">─</span
                      ><span>Supports autonomic and hormonal balance</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex gap-3 text-sm text-brand-espresso/85">
                      <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-brand-moss">─</span
                      ><span>Deep concentration and steadiness of mind</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex gap-3 text-sm text-brand-espresso/85">
                      <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-brand-moss">─</span
                      ><span>Reduces stress and anxiety</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex gap-3 text-sm text-brand-espresso/85">
                      <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-brand-moss">─</span
                      ><span>Deepens the breath and supports sleep quality</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex gap-3 text-sm text-brand-espresso/85">
                      <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-brand-moss">─</span
                      ><span>Elevates meditation and cultivates inner stillness</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex gap-3 text-sm text-brand-espresso/85">
                      <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-brand-moss">─</span
                      ><span>Toward calm, vital, everyday living</span>
                    </li>
                  </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-10">
                  <a
                    href="/hatha-yoga/en/contact/"
                    class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-7 py-3.5 text-[14px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] font-medium transition-colors duration-300 active:translate-y-px bg-brand-espresso text-white hover:bg-brand-moss"
                    >Book a Class</a
                  >
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="ja-band ja-band-sand py-24 md:py-32">
          <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-6 md:px-10 max-w-3xl">
            <p
              class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss"
            >
              Frequently asked questions
            </p>
            <div
              class="mt-10 divide-y divide-white/15 border-t border-brand-espresso/20"
            >
              <details class="group py-6">
                <summary
                  class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-display text-xl text-brand-espresso md:text-2xl"
                >
                  <span>Can I join without any yoga experience?</span
                  ><span
                    aria-hidden="true"
                    class="shrink-0 text-brand-moss transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45"
                    >+</span
                  >
                </summary>
                <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso">
                  Yes. Upa Yoga is designed as an entry point, and instruction
                  is adapted to each person&#x27;s condition.
                </p>
              </details>
              <details class="group py-6">
                <summary
                  class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-display text-xl text-brand-espresso md:text-2xl"
                >
                  <span>What should I bring?</span
                  ><span
                    aria-hidden="true"
                    class="shrink-0 text-brand-moss transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45"
                    >+</span
                  >
                </summary>
                <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso">
                  Comfortable clothing and a yoga mat. Mat rental may be
                  available depending on the venue.
                </p>
              </details>
              <details class="group py-6">
                <summary
                  class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-display text-xl text-brand-espresso md:text-2xl"
                >
                  <span>How is this different from fitness yoga?</span
                  ><span
                    aria-hidden="true"
                    class="shrink-0 text-brand-moss transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45"
                    >+</span
                  >
                </summary>
                <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso">
                  Fitness yoga centers on physical exercise. Hatha Yoga works
                  from an understanding of the body&#x27;s mechanics toward a
                  fuller practice that includes mind and energy.
                </p>
              </details>
              <details class="group py-6">
                <summary
                  class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-display text-xl text-brand-espresso md:text-2xl"
                >
                  <span>Tell me about the corporate program.</span
                  ><span
                    aria-hidden="true"
                    class="shrink-0 text-brand-moss transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45"
                    >+</span
                  >
                </summary>
                <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso">
                  Programs are customized for organizations pursuing health
                  management, in formats practical for the office. Contact us
                  for details.
                </p>
              </details>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
</YogaLayout>
